Package: next-server-compat
Version: 0.0.1
Architecture: amd64
Maintainer: The NeXT Project Team <package@nextpanel.dev>
Homepage: https://github.com/The-NeXT-Project/NeXT-Server
Provides: next-server
Conflicts: next-server
Replaces: next-server
Description: NeXT-Panel node server, built on sing-box (x86-64-v1 build).
 The same release as next-server, built for any x86-64 CPU. Install it
 instead of next-server on CPUs without x86-64-v3 (AVX2, BMI2, FMA), where
 the next-server build refuses to start.
